#            touches no editable path, so editable content equals the base.
# Generated: senpai/tools/agx-census-probe/add_verbose_dump.py
# Sites:     48 MLXFastKernel.callAsFunction invocations across three files -- every
#            `outputDTypes:` argument. None of these files uses `initValue:` or
#            `stream:`, so `outputDTypes:` is always the last labelled argument
#            and `verbose:` goes immediately after it.
#              Sources/MLXFastModel/LagunaRuntimeModel.swift   33
#              Sources/MLXFastModel/LagunaRuntimeLayers.swift   9
#              Sources/MLXFastModel/LagunaLmHeadPrune.swift     6
#
# Re-apply from a clean checkout at that base:
#   python3 senpai/tools/agx-census-probe/add_verbose_dump.py
# or
#   git apply research/maple-frieren-r92-verbose-dump.patch
#
# RELOCATION WARNING: this diff carries absolute line numbers into files that
# every experiment edits. If `git apply` rejects, do NOT hand-fix the hunks --
# rerun add_verbose_dump.py, which is line-number independent.
#
# NOT A SUBMISSION CANDIDATE. `verbose: true` makes MLX print the fully
# generated MSL to std::cout at every kernel op construction
# (Vendor/mlx-swift/Source/Cmlx/mlx/mlx/backend/common/metal_kernel.cpp:342-347),
# which is pure host-side I/O on the scored hot path. It is reverted later in
# this branch's history and contributes zero editable bytes to the submitted
# surface.
